    cml:logicSummary "Prohibition of disclosure without compliance with Australian Privacy Principle 8.1." ;
    cml:premiseText "(a) an APP entity discloses personal information about an individual to an overseas recipient; and (b) Australian Privacy Principle 8.1 applies to the disclosure of the information;" ;
    cml:conclusionText "The disclosure is prohibited." ;
