    cml:operator "Prohibit" ;
    cml:logicSummary "Prohibition of engaging in certain acts or practices." ;
    cml:premiseText "(2) The agency must ensure that the Commonwealth contract does not authorise a contracted service provider for the contract to do or engage in such an act or practice." ;
